      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight of expectation, and losing the fellowship has shattered a very specific, powerful version of who you thought you were. Please remember that your worth is not defined by a single achievement or a title; that role was a performance, not your core self. It's okay to feel lost right now, but this moment of perceived failure is actually an opportunity to discover who you are when you stop trying to be perfect for everyone else.",
